 "caption": "On 4 October 2021, Facebook, Instagram and WhatsApp all went down for about six hours. Mark Zuckerberg's wealth fell by more than $6 billion that day. For small businesses that take orders in chats, it meant sales they couldn't make and customers they couldn't answer.\n\nIf your whole business lives inside one app, you're renting it. A website is the one place customers can always find you.\n\nIf that app went dark tomorrow, how would customers find you? DM us the word OWN and we'll show you what yours could look like.\n\n#moodbod #websitedesign #whatsappbusiness #smallbusinessnamibia #windhoek\n\nSources: NPR (Oct 5 2021), Snopes, Wikipedia 2021 Facebook outage."
